{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Quiet Days of Dorothy</strong> is a cozy narrative game about finding comfort in small things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early 2020. As the world goes into lockdown, Dorothy spends her quiet days in quarantine caring for jars of sourdough starters. By sharing them with neighbors, old friends, and strangers, she begins to form unexpected connections and exchange stories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for and grow your sourdough starters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, rest, and nurture them through simple, soothing mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/380130a580b67468a14e6274fea3dfe3.poster.avif?t=1755403508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/380130a580b67468a14e6274fea3dfe3.webm?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/380130a580b67468a14e6274fea3dfe3.mp4?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build connections through sharing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send starters to others, receive recipes in return, and uncover personal stories through the in-game messaging system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/dbb57a3e2c7e8f9e775243858bf35c61.poster.avif?t=1755403508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/dbb57a3e2c7e8f9e775243858bf35c61.webm?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/dbb57a3e2c7e8f9e775243858bf35c61.mp4?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle, everyday rituals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From baking bread to watching the rain, enjoy moments that bring warmth and calm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/8360a570b6be2e88cfe65e3911ff8329.poster.avif?t=1755403508\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/8360a570b6be2e88cfe65e3911ff8329.webm?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/extras/8360a570b6be2e88cfe65e3911ff8329.mp4?t=1755403508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about kindness in difficult times</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in isolation, small acts of kindness can bridge distances and bring hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Quiet Days of Dorothy invites you to slow down, listen, and find hope in every starter you share.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947720?t=1755403508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947720?t=1755403508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/68565be3b84f22d3b6ba15c1bf7111613da74923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755403508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947720/68565be3b84f22d3b6ba15c1bf7111613da74923